2026-11-08T22:15:01.5555127Z   ok   without the Carnot derate the buffer collapses to the plain curve
2026-11-08T22:15:01.5555392Z   ok   the terminal credit repays a stored buffer kWh at the flow-derated COP the simulation charged to store it, less what the tank loses first
2026-11-08T22:15:01.5555520Z   ok   and at -5 C that haircut is small: winter storage is not discouraged
2026-11-08T22:15:01.5555781Z   ok   which is genuinely dearer than the plain curve the old code paid
