2026-11-08T22:15:01.5556432Z -- v4.0.5 — settlement caps: the lower zone's slab, a reachable tank
2026-11-08T22:15:01.5556535Z   ok   two-zone slab cap is sized from the lower zone alone
2026-11-08T22:15:01.5556655Z   ok   and it moves with the learned split, like the dynamics it settles
2026-11-08T22:15:01.5556753Z   ok   single-zone keeps the historical formula exactly
