2026-11-08T22:15:01.6661989Z   ok   a re-driven pin is not reproduced by a driver that only sees the row the mutant made stale: the row is hidden from the mutant's tree, and a code check still kills it (R10 mutation-anchor)
2026-11-08T22:15:01.6662342Z   ok   invalidated_rows names exactly the rows pinned to a rewritten line, the ledger without them agrees with the rewritten file, and an unpinned line names none (R10 mutation-anchor)
2026-11-08T22:15:01.6662496Z   ok   mutation-nightly rotates its seed by date and surfaces the report (R9-F10.13)
2026-11-08T22:15:01.6662631Z   ok   a changed-scope pool draws only sites on lines the diff modified
2026-11-08T22:15:01.6662763Z   ok   and a comment-, whitespace-, docs- or test-only diff draws nothing
2026-11-08T22:15:01.6662852Z   ok   and --scope full still draws from every site
2026-11-08T22:15:01.6663036Z   ok   the null control is drawn from a file of the line-scoped pool, on a line the diff never touched
2026-11-08T22:15:01.6663151Z   ok   and an empty pool passes before a null control is sought
2026-11-08T22:15:01.6663385Z   ok   the null run's tree differs from the baseline tree on exactly the null comment's line, and main() drives it through null_edit
2026-11-08T22:15:01.6663617Z   ok   the null control runs under every driver in the baseline phase, and its stress.py run shares the runner with nothing
